WEBVTT

00:27:29.716 --> 00:27:32.156
has been funded by the federal government,

00:27:32.196 --> 00:27:34.836
by NIH, with taxpayer money.

00:27:34.876 --> 00:27:39.596
And so we feel a responsibility
to make this information available

00:27:39.636 --> 00:27:41.956
to other researchers

00:27:41.956 --> 00:27:45.636
who want to ask their own
questions about our data.

00:27:47.996 --> 00:27:51.116
WPR: Well, Bob, you’ve shared
so many great things with us.

00:27:51.796 --> 00:27:55.316
You know, I feel like
if people were listening

00:27:55.316 --> 00:27:57.196
and trying to absorb all of it,

00:27:57.236 --> 00:27:59.156
and at the very end of this conversation

00:27:59.156 --> 00:28:03.156
you want just one nugget of information,
that if you missed everything,